flowchart LR
  A[Portfolio Intelligence] --> B[Detect drift and idle cash]
  B --> C[Portfolio Agent proposal]
  C --> D{Suitability check}
  D -- Pass --> E[Generate proposal]
  D -- Fail --> F[Adjust and re-check]
  F --> D
  E --> G[Compliance language check]
  G --> H{Approval needed?}
  H -- Yes --> I[Human approves]
  H -- No --> J[Create rebalance task]
  I --> J
  J --> K[Log to AI Agent Run]
